  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(156.12pt, 167.28pt, "† First author: Huaijin Ma (dx120250065@stu.yzu.edu.cn) ")
  #line-at(41.16pt, 191.76pt, "* Corresponding author: Kaiyan Cao (kycao@yzu.edu.cn), Jinpeng Yang (yangjp@yzu.edu.cn), Jian Wang ")
  #line-at(240.12pt, 216.12pt, "(wangjian@yzu.edu.cn) ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(36pt, 256.92pt, "Abstract: ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(36pt, 281.4pt, "Topological quasiparticles, such as merons and bimerons, are characterized by non-trivial textures that exhibit ")
  #line-at(36pt, 305.76pt, "remarkably robust transport against deformation, offering significant potential for information processing. ")
  #line-at(36pt, 330.24pt, "While these phenomena have been explored in various systems, acoustic realizations remain challenging. Here, ")
  #line-at(36pt, 354.72pt, "we report that acoustic meron topological textures were successfully realized using designed Archimedean-")
  #line-at(36pt, 379.2pt, "like square spiral metastructures via the excitation of spoof surface acoustic waves (SSAWs). By applying ")
  #line-at(36pt, 403.56pt, "mirror-symmetric combinatorial operations to the unit structures, we further construct composite chiral ")
  #line-at(36pt, 428.04pt, "metastructures that enable both one-dimensional and two-dimensional stable transport of acoustic bimerons. ")
  #line-at(36pt, 452.52pt, "It is further revealed that bimeron transport originates from the locked opposite phase differences of SSAWs, ")
  #line-at(36pt, 477pt, "induced by the handedness of the cavity resonant modes. The intrinsic robustness of the meron textures against ")
  #line-at(36pt, 501.36pt, "structural defects is confirmed through the calculation of their topological charge. Our findings establish stable ")
  #line-at(36pt, 525.84pt, "acoustic bimeron transport as a topologically resilient foundation for future acoustic information processing ")
  #line-at(36pt, 550.32pt, "and storage technologies. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(36pt, 745.92pt, "Keywords: ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(94.92pt, 745.92pt, "Acoustics; Topological Bimeron; Transport; Chiral Metastructure")
]

