  #line-at(60pt, 444.36pt, "In summary, we successfully generated acoustic meron topological textures on metasurfaces via spoof ")
  #line-at(36pt, 468.84pt, "surface acoustic waves, with their topology quantified by the associated topological charge. The SSAWs serve ")
  #line-at(36pt, 493.2pt, "as a robust medium for observing and manipulating topological merons. In the composite chiral metastructures, ")
  #line-at(36pt, 517.68pt, "cavity resonant modes with distinct handedness give rise to merons and anti-merons with opposite polarities. ")
